(38966,2,0,'Still, I fear I was lettin\' my temper drive me ta bein\' rash. Thrall devoted himself to makin\' the Horde what it is, so I\'ve no eagerness to be leavin\' it on a whim.  Dis will be needin\' much more thought.',12,0,100,1,0,20106,'Vol\'jin'),
