(38966,7,0,'Thrall!  I am glad ya be well.  Dere were rumors otherwise.',12,0,100,1,0,20111,'Vol\'jin'),
(38966,8,0,'I must beg ya council, my friend.  I can\'t be standin\' by Garrosh while he be turnin\' our people against each other for tha sake of war.  My respect for you does not extend to dis new Horde... I am tinkin\' of leadin\' my people away.',12,0,100,1,0,20112,'Vol\'jin'),
