(38966,10,0,'Ya be strong and proud, youngblood.  Tha Darkspear will be honored ta have you fight beside d\'em.',12,0,100,1,0,20114,'Vol\'jin'),
(38966,11,0,'Dese be dark times, but our people will be stayin\' with tha Horde for tha good of all.  ',12,0,100,1,0,20115,'Vol\'jin'),
(38966,12,0,'Thrall\'s words be true. Dey always be. The Horde is much more den a few old, stubborn leaders and a handful of heroes from Northrend. The people be cryin\' Garrosh\'s name... at least for now.',12,0,100,1,0,20116,'Vol\'jin'),
